# Pre-commit: fast checks on staged files, then the AI review.
#
# Husky sets `core.hooksPath` to `.husky/_`, which makes git ignore
# `.git/hooks/pre-commit` entirely. The Gentleman Guardian Angel hook lived there, so adding
# Husky without this line would have stopped the review from running — silently, and only
# noticeable the next time it failed to catch something.

npx --no-install lint-staged

# Kept second, and kept at all: it caught an index that made two recurring series impossible on
# the same day, and a writer that crashed when you edited a series' weekdays.
gga run
